fore, tee during, close after)\\n6d09590 [guest] TASK-1: pin the invocation-output capture path (stdout wiring + opencode JSONL session.log persistence)\\n68819f7 [guest] chore: commit all\\n190d088 [guest] brief: edit via TUI\\n\",\"metadata\":{\"output\":\"[fix/guest_fix-tailing 9d36378] [guest] implementation: add summary\\n 1 file changed, 93 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)\\n9d36378 [guest] implementation: add summary\\n2312c8d [guest] TASK-4: document the log-vs-tail distinction (log tab = run.log event summary, l tail = live session.log verbose stream)\\n6bed9fc [guest] TASK-3: point the detail view's 'l' tail at the job's session.log (verbose stream) instead of run.log\\n4489086 [guest] TASK-2: stream each invocation's raw output live into session.log (header before, tee during, close after)\\n6d09590 [guest] TASK-1: pin the invocation-output capture path (stdout wiring + opencode JSONL session.log persistence)\\n68819f7 [guest] chore: commit all\\n190d088 [guest] brief: edit via TUI\\n\",\"exit\":0,\"truncated\":false},\"title\":\"git add -A && git commit -m \\\"[guest] implementation: add summary\\\" && git status --short && git log --oneline -7\",\"time\":{\"start\":1787921041831,\"end\":1787921041832}},\"id\":\"prt_0486607de001n1gAzvJSbG0X4N\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_fb7a913aeffe0rISXrjcCChio6\",\"messageID\":\"msg_04865fc14001xoCVy49hI22xsb\"}}\n+{\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1787921041925,\"sessionID\":\"ses_fb7a913aeffe0rISXrjcCChio6\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_0486609fd001SzKzwnbU4znGxO\",\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\"snapshot\":\"\",\"messageID\":\"msg_04865fc14001xoCVy49hI22xsb\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_fb7a913aeffe0rISXrjcCChio6\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":232271,\"input\":243,\"output\":92,\"reasoning\":0,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":231936}},\"cost\":0.001737732}}\n+{\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1787921043589,\"sessionID\":\"ses_fb7a913aeffe0rISXrjcCChio6\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_04866108300192qec81b6j7TI3\",\"message