\": \\\"TASK-2: Stream invocation output live into session.log (header before, tee during, close after; AgentRunner interface + fake runner; update loop-exit sweep comment; adapt tests)\\\",\\n    \\\"status\\\": \\\"completed\\\",\\n    \\\"priority\\\": \\\"high\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\\"content\\\": \\\"TASK-3: Point the detail view 'l' tail at session.log (app.go, detail.go, tail_test.go) + create session.log at run start\\\",\\n    \\\"status\\\": \\\"completed\\\",\\n    \\\"priority\\\": \\\"high\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\\"content\\\": \\\"TASK-4: Update docs (docs/AGENTS.md, README.md, project-template/docs/AGENTS.md, docs/ROADMAP.md)\\\",\\n    \\\"status\\\": \\\"completed\\\",\\n    \\\"priority\\\": \\\"medium\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\\"content\\\": \\\"Write implementation.md and commit\\\",\\n    \\\"status\\\": \\\"completed\\\",\\n    \\\"priority\\\": \\\"medium\\\"\\n  }\\n]\",\"metadata\":{\"todos\":[{\"content\":\"TASK-1: Verify invocation-output capture (cmd.Stdout wiring) + pin with tests (docker stdout capture test + opencode JSONL session.log test)\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"priority\":\"high\"},{\"content\":\"TASK-2: Stream invocation output live into session.log (header before, tee during, close after; AgentRunner interface + fake runner; update loop-exit sweep comment; adapt tests)\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"priority\":\"high\"},{\"content\":\"TASK-3: Point the detail view 'l' tail at session.log (app.go, detail.go, tail_test.go) + create session.log at run start\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"priority\":\"high\"},{\"content\":\"TASK-4: Update docs (docs/AGENTS.md, README.md, project-template/docs/AGENTS.md, docs/ROADMAP.md)\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"priority\":\"medium\"},{\"content\":\"Write implementation.md and commit\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"priority\":\"medium\"}],\"truncated\":false},\"title\":\"0 todos\",\"time\":{\"start\":1787921052516,\"end\":1787921052517}},\"id\":\"prt_048662a49001YI6DeLFP7BKeHy\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_fb7a913aeffe0rISXrjcCChio6\",\"messageID\":\"msg_048662305001sg3IoO6NFP8LDN\"}}\n+{\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1787921052590,\"sessionID\":\"ses_fb7a913aeffe0rISXrjcCChio6\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_0486633a6001vhJzXEn3XSfbjE\",\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\"snapshot\":\"\",\"messageID\":\"msg_048662305001sg3IoO6NFP8LDN\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_fb7a913aeffe0rISXrjcCChio6\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":233477,\"input\":498,\"output\":275,\"reasoning\":0,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":232704}},\"cost\":0.001919988}}\n+{\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1787921055143,\"sessionID\":\"ses_fb7a913aeffe0rISXrjcCChio6\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_048663da6001QlLkvzf31EU9Gb\",\"messageID\":\"msg_0486633ad001l3ELiq1AX8B1t7\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_fb7a913aeffe0rISXrjcCChio6\",\"snapshot\":\"\",\"type\":\"step-start\"}}\n+{\"type\":\"text\",\"timestamp\":1787921063639,\"sessionID\":\"ses_fb7a913aeffe0rISXrjcCChio6\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_048664098001NgCHT21Ht3YUb1\",\"messageID\":\"msg_0486633ad001l3ELiq1AX8B1t7\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_fb7a913aeffe0rISXrjcCChio6\",\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"All four tasks from `tasks.md` are implemented, tested, and committed. The worktree is clean.\\n\\n## Summary\\n\\n**The bug:** the detail view's \\\"l\\\" tail ran `tail -f` on mg-jdi's sidecar `run.log` — the exact same file the log tab (key 5) renders — and `run.log` only grows at invocation boundaries, so the tail showed no live stream. The raw output *was* being captured but persisted post-hoc.\\n\\n**The fix (log-vs-tail distinction made real):**\\n- **TASK-1** — Verified and pinned the capture path: `cmd.Stdout = stdout` in `DockerInvocation.Run` captures the full `--print` stream byte-exact (no drops). Added session-package tests with a fake docker emitting an opencode JSONL stream (full capture, missing-trailing-newline preservation, non-zero-exit capture), and extended the opencode JSONL marker test to assert the raw stream lands verbatim in `session.log`.\\n- **TASK-2** — mg-jdi now streams each invocation's raw output **live** into the job's `session.log`: `AgentRunner.Run` takes a `live io.Writer`; the runner tees the container's stdout via `io.MultiWriter`; the loop writes the section header (agent/attempt/timestamp) *before* the invocation, streams bytes during it, and closes with a trailing-newline guarantee. `appendSessionLog` replaced by `openSessionLog` + a `sessionLog` writer; `ensureSessionLogFile` creates the file at run start. The loop-exit sweep comment was updated (the per-invocation sweep now commits each live-written section; the loop-exit sweep is the backstop).\\n- **TASK-3** — The detail view's \\\"l\\\" tail now follows `<job.Dir>/session.log` (gated on that file existing, status \\\"→ tailing session.log in …\\\", footer hint updated); the log tab stays on `run.log`. All three tail tests updated, plus a new header-before-invocation loop test.\\n- **TASK-4** — Docs updated to the log-vs-tail distinction: `docs/AGENTS.md`, `README.md` (four spots), `project-template/docs/AGENTS.md` (kept in sync), `docs/ROADMAP.md` (reader side partially landed note), and a stale `appendSessionLog` reference in `scripts/entrypoint.sh`.\\n\\nFull test suite passes (`go test ./...` — all 16 packages ok). Commits are on `fix/guest_fix-tailing` (matches the brief's `branch:` field), one per task plus the `implementation.md` summary commit.\\n\\n**Known follow-ups** (recorded in implementation.md): intermediate in-container agent commits may snapshot a partially-written session.log section (cosmetic — final content is always complete); actual per-event flush timing of a live opencode run wasn't measurable in this environment (capture is pinned byte-exact by tests); the ROADMAP's richer in-TUI structured step-level view remains out of scope.\",\"time\":{\"start\":1787921055896,\"end\":1787921063637}}}\n+{\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1787921063662,\"sessionID\":\"ses_fb7a913aeffe0rISXrjcCChio6\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_048665ee2001X86ekKre06YrUe\",\"reason\":\"stop\",\"snapshot\":\"\",\"messageID\":\"msg_0486633ad001l3ELiq1AX8B1t7\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_fb7a913aeffe0rISXrjcCChio6\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":234415,\"input\":280,\"output\":663,\"reasoning\":0,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":233472}},\"cost\":0.002133484}}\n","exit":0,"truncated":true,"outputPath":"/home/claude/.local/share/opencode/tool-output/tool_0486b934e001y2hXNhJPv83fNW"},"title":"git diff -- docs/jobs/guest_fix-tailing/session.log","time":{"start":1787921404756,"end":1787921404763}},"id":"prt_0486b921e001O2fAzASXEsq9qw","sessionID":"ses_fb7999c4fffe1anLtOEgzjXUGJ","messageID":"msg_0486a2986001HAO294Ma3n1Rjw"}}
